      "writtenOn": "2024-11-18T20:49:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the connect socket, the legacy code is waiting for the app data to be received. For the listen socket, the new code is waiting for the acceptance signal from the framework. There is not much commonality between handling the app data and the acceptance signal, such as data structures or subsequent function calls. I would rather leave it as a separate handling than optimizing the code.",
